        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Stronger Engagement for Indian Health Needs Act of </strong><strong>2025</strong></p><p>This bill elevates the current position of the Director of the Indian Health Service within the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) to Assistant Secretary for Indian Health within HHS.</p>",
